        <div class="info">
          <p>Devon Grant is a Data Scientist at Virturo, where he specializes in harnessing machine learning and artificial intelligence to solve complex business problems. A native of Chicago, Devon’s passion for technology and problem-solving led him to pursue a career in data science, focusing on optimizing business operations through predictive analytics and automation.</p>

          <h5>Education:</h5>
          <p>Devon holds a Master's degree in Data Science from Northwestern University and has completed specialized coursework in Machine Learning and Artificial Intelligence through a renowned online platform.</p>

          <h5>Experience:</h5>
          <p>Before joining Virturo, Devon worked at a global consulting firm where he gained extensive experience analyzing large datasets to inform strategic decisions for clients in the retail and logistics sectors. At Virturo, he collaborates closely with the product development and engineering teams to integrate AI-driven solutions into the company's operations, improving efficiency and customer experience.</p>
